// sealed and syntax in the editor (§9.1, §4.4): the parsing rule outside the sealed module
// for its entity (here is the entry with the word twice in the block) is an error on the
// rule announcement; its word is the program rule, there is no error.
// program: editor_sealed.tz
open_view module
// expect: kind="error" text="twice: модуль geo.rules запечатан (sealed)
// expect: kind="n_fn" pieces=["syntax twice {body} again => "
// Twicy is the rule of the program block: no error, twice is the write of the module
pointer 1 @syntax 0 12
key 1 Backspace
key 1 y
// expect: kind="n_fn" pieces=["syntax twicy {body} again => "
// expect-not: kind="error"
